  "description": "Wyatt Hess is a freshman quarterback at university. As soon as he enrolled, he found himself sharing a room with the prince of the football world, Demarcus Winter. The strange thing is that there isn’t a single girl to be seen around this seemingly perfect prince. What’s more… he’s a virgin?! And so began ‘Operation: Deflower Demarcus Winter’.\n\n...Hang on? But why did he suddenly go to the loo whilst we were talking? And why is his face turning red? *(Source: Lezhin, translated)*\n\n**Original Novel:**  \nVolumes: [RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/2036058889), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/YSNT45269), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/novel/mh2663), [Bookcube](https://www.bookcube.com/detail.asp?series_num=920015250)  \nChapters: [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/YSNT19637), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=10143193), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/69764537/), [Joara](https://www.joara.com/book/1683873)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/perfect_spiral), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/perfect_spiral)",
